OL,3,GNEWSAMetro extension plans revealed at
OL,4,Apublic events
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for the expansion of the
OL,7,FTyne and Wear Metro - including the
OL,8,Froute, new stations and road changes -
OL,9,Fare to be shown to the public at a
OL,10,Fseries of events.
OL,12,FThe #900m scheme to add a line through
OL,13,FWashington was unveiled June 2025 and
OL,14,Fit is hoped trains will start running
OL,15,Falong it in 2033.
OL,17,FMetro operator Nexus has revealed
OL,18,Fproposed locations of three new
OL,19,Fstations, some of the road changes
OL,20,Finvolved and plans to cross the River
OL,21,FWear via the 188-year-old Victoria
OL,22,FViaduct.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
