OL,3,GNEWSAMetro extension plans revealed at
OL,4,Apublic events
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company is holding 14 public events
OL,7,Facross the region in September so
OL,8,Fresidents can learn more about the
OL,9,Fplans and give feedback before the
OL,10,Fscheme is finalised.
